"Use <b>Refresh Terms</b> to load them for chosen models, modules\n"
"               or languages (leave empty for everything). Every translatable\n"
"               term is collected — Python, JavaScript, QWeb, fields, views and\n"
"               menus — whether already translated or not."
msgstr "Gebruik <b>Verfris terme</b> om hulle vir gekose modelle, modules\n               of tale te laai (laat leeg vir alles). Elke vertaalbare\n               term word versamel — Python, JavaScript, QWeb, velde, aansigte en\n               kieslyste — of dit reeds vertaal is of nie."

